{"Title":"An Act relative to dental hygienist reciprocal licensure","BillNumber":"H3880","DocketNumber":"HD4094","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"T_C1","Name":"Tackey Chan","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/T_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-23T10:19:01.973"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"T_C1","Name":"Tackey Chan","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/T_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-23T10:19:01.9733333"},{"Id":"MDB0","Name":"Michael D. Brady","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MDB0","ResponseDate":"2023-02-22T10:10:23.7666667"},{"Id":"PMO","Name":"Patrick M. O'Connor","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PMO","ResponseDate":"2023-04-05T16:57:16.9566667"},{"Id":"JBA1","Name":"Jennifer Balinsky Armini","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JBA1","ResponseDate":"2023-06-05T11:49:56.9966667"},{"Id":"R_M2","Name":"Rady Mom","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/R_M2","ResponseDate":"2023-06-21T14:30:09.31"},{"Id":"JPL1","Name":"Jack Patrick Lewis","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JPL1","ResponseDate":"2023-06-21T14:30:09.31"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3880/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Chan of Quincy, a petition (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Tackey Chan and Michael D. Brady relative to dental hygienist reciprocal licensure.  Consumer Protection and Professional Licensure.","DocumentText":"\tSection 51 of chapter 112 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting after the third paragraph, the following paragraph:-\r\n\tThe board may, without examination upon payment of a fee determined annually by the commissioner of administration under the provision of section three B of chapter seven, register and issue a dental hygienist license to a dentist who has been lawfully in practice for at least five years in another state, country, or province if he presents to the board a certificate of registration and duration of practice from an out-of-state board of dental examiners or other like registration entity of such state, country, or province; provided, that such other jurisdiction shall require a degree of competency as determined by the board equal to that required of applicants in this commonwealth.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H33","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H33"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J17","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J17"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[{"FiscalType":null,"Amount":"More Than 100,000.00 "}],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J24","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J24"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable with Amendment","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H34","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H34"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[{"AmendmentNumber":"1","ParentBillNumber":"H4842","Branch":"Senate","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4842/Branches/Senate/Amendments/1/"},{"AmendmentNumber":"1","ParentBillNumber":"H3880","Branch":"House","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3880/Branches/House/Amendments/1/"}]}